abstract: >-
  Genomics DomainAdapter for the indicium ecosystem. Contributes the
  classification vocabulary (primary_domain, EDAM-derived subdomains,
  curated techniques and claim qualifiers), exact-match claim enrichment
  over identifier grammars, HGNC gene nomenclature and EDAM concept
  labels, and VCF + GFF3 projections into ASB claim dicts.
